citly scope which of the ten rules this description-length sample can calibrate).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.1812,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Selection key is description length only: 'description length 7,200-7,999 or at least 8,000 characters'","Several rules in the parent matrix (immobile-drastic-springtail comment) target comments: 'a comment versus the description/last five comments' (near/cross-history duplication) and 'a comment has no non-empty Delta, Evidence, Decision, Blocker, or Next field' (structurally empty update)","ABSENCE: the plan never states how the description-length-selected population yields enough applicable COMMENT artifacts to compute meaningful TP/FP/FN/TN for comment-targeting rules"],"finding":"Population is selected only by description length, but several frozen rules target comment content, so those rules' confusion-matrix denominators may be near-empty or unrepresentative.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f56e68f78fbc6e9d1","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach (bullet 1: 'Build a read-only population of work tickets ... with description length 7,200-7,999 or at least 8,000 characters') and Acceptance Criteria line 4","norm_id":"n33212301251e2f17","priority":0.4188,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A rule like structurally-empty-update or comment-to-comment near-duplication has 0-2 applicable artifacts in the sample, making its reported percentages uninterpretable","Reviewers mark most comment-targeting rules 'not applicable', so the calibration silently covers only the description-length rules"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a second selection dimension (e.g., include tickets with long or numerous comments) or explicitly declare which rules are in-scope for this description-length sample and which are deferred, so no rule reports a matrix over a near-empty denominator.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"bina